        "Alongside its chemistry business, Flic Film curates and respools film stock sourced from established manufacturers rather than coating its own emulsion. This includes genuine Kodak Vision3 cinema stock, Kodak Double-X, Kodak Ektachrome and Kodak Aerocolor, as well as film from the Filmotec/ORWO lineage and Foma's Fomapan range, repackaged into formats suited to still photographers.",
