        "Bergger doesn't coat its own film. Its flagship Pancro 400 is manufactured on Bergger's behalf by InovisCoat in Germany, a specialist coating company operating former Agfa and Wolfen coating technology, while its printing papers are produced by Harman Technology in the UK and its developing chemistry by German manufacturers. Bergger operates as a focused brand and distribution business rather than a vertically integrated manufacturer.",
